WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.630
- There's no shortage
of social media posts

00:00:02.630 --> 00:00:03.970
that will put a smile on your face.

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:05.730
My job is to bring you
the best of the best.

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:07.275
This is What I'm Liking.

00:00:07.275 --> 00:00:10.300
(upbeat music)
(audience applauding)

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.020
Diapers, formula, wipes, bibs, bottles.

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:14.430
Having a baby has its joys,

00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:15.940
but also has the costs.

00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:17.610
They can add up real quick, y'all.

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:18.590
One mama here in LA

00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:20.510
is trying to make it a
little easier for parents

00:00:20.510 --> 00:00:21.650
in a super creative way.

00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:22.567
Check this out.

00:00:23.491 --> 00:00:26.074
(upbeat music)

00:00:41.581 --> 00:00:42.925
(audience applauding)

00:00:42.925 --> 00:00:44.500
So far, Crystal and her husband

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:48.510
have tucked away more than a
$1000 for unsuspecting parents.

00:00:48.510 --> 00:00:49.343
It's so cool.

00:00:49.343 --> 00:00:51.330
We have Crystal on the line right now.

00:00:51.330 --> 00:00:52.831
What's up?

00:00:52.831 --> 00:00:56.013
(audience applauding)
- Hi Kelly.

00:00:56.013 --> 00:00:58.180
- Hi, first of all, you
have such a beautiful heart.

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.020
What an amazing thing to do for someone.

00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:01.950
Especially like, it's a struggle,

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:04.510
all the costs that it
takes to having a baby,

00:01:04.510 --> 00:01:05.343
we all would know.

00:01:05.343 --> 00:01:06.960
But how did you come up with this?

00:01:06.960 --> 00:01:10.480
- Yeah, so my husband and I are
expecting baby number three.

00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:12.708
- Congratulations.
- And, we went...

00:01:12.708 --> 00:01:13.541
(audience applauding)

00:01:13.541 --> 00:01:14.374
Thank you.

00:01:16.520 --> 00:01:18.700
So, we went out shopping for the new baby,

00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:20.860
and were so amazed and shocked

00:01:20.860 --> 00:01:22.660
at how expensive things have gotten.

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:24.390
And remembered how expensive

00:01:24.390 --> 00:01:25.800
they were when we were new parents.

00:01:25.800 --> 00:01:28.770
And it's a pandemic, lots
of people are out of work.

00:01:28.770 --> 00:01:31.460
And we just couldn't imagine
being in a tough position.

00:01:31.460 --> 00:01:34.880
Having to decide between baby
products and, you know, bills.

00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:37.030
So, we took all the
money out of our wallet,

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:39.660
and hid it in some baby products.

00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:41.170
And we made a day out of it.

00:01:41.170 --> 00:01:44.260
We went to the ATM, hit
a couple more stores,

00:01:44.260 --> 00:01:45.840
and shared it on social media

00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:48.170
in hopes that some local parents in need

00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:51.400
would hopefully find it and
get some baby products too.

00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:53.510
And we totally didn't
expect it to go viral,

00:01:53.510 --> 00:01:55.180
but it did.

00:01:55.180 --> 00:01:57.060
- Well, since your post did go viral,

00:01:57.060 --> 00:01:59.290
other people are following
in your lead, right?

00:01:59.290 --> 00:02:00.123
- Yeah.

00:02:00.123 --> 00:02:01.040
We are so shocked

00:02:01.040 --> 00:02:02.270
and it really warms our heart

00:02:02.270 --> 00:02:04.930
to know that there are
people all over the country

00:02:04.930 --> 00:02:06.840
that have been sending us videos,

00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:09.420
sharing that they've done the
same thing with their kids,

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:10.990
and it just really warms our heart

00:02:10.990 --> 00:02:12.250
to know that there are other people

00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:15.080
that were inspired to
share kindness and joyness.

00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:16.080
- Oh, absolutely.

00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:17.440
Thank you so much, Crystal.

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:19.264
I'm liking your post right now.

00:02:19.264 --> 00:02:22.262
(audience applauding)

00:02:22.262 --> 00:02:23.095
And that is not all,

00:02:23.095 --> 00:02:24.190
our season long partner,

00:02:24.190 --> 00:02:26.330
Pilot Pen, the go-to pen
of Kelly Clarkson Show,

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:29.820
thinks what you're doing
is as incredible as we do.

00:02:29.820 --> 00:02:31.760
In recognition, they'd
like to write you a check

00:02:31.760 --> 00:02:34.480
with their G2 gelling pen for $1000.

00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:35.616
How's that sound?

00:02:35.616 --> 00:02:36.465
(audience applauding)

00:02:36.465 --> 00:02:38.025
- Oh my goodness!
- (Kelly laughs)

00:02:38.025 --> 00:02:39.500
- Thank you, oh my God.

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:41.406
- Absolutely.

00:02:41.406 --> 00:02:43.830
I believe that what you put
out there comes back to you.

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:44.810
So, thank you so much

00:02:44.810 --> 00:02:46.250
for your beautiful heart in this message.

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:47.953
I hope it creates a domino effect.

